{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cggk5QZhZWgRWRMntfqvZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Results:** Dq = 1743 cm⁻¹, B ≈ 781 cm⁻¹, C ≈ 3220 cm⁻¹. These are the values that fit all four bands for octahedral d³. I solved C numerically by hand, so treat its last digit or two as approximate.\n\n**Band assignments (octahedral d³)**\n- 17 430 cm⁻¹ = ⁴A₂g → ⁴T₂g. This band equals 10Dq.\n- 25 000 cm⁻¹ = ⁴A₂g → ⁴T₁g(F)\n- 39 000 cm⁻¹ = ⁴A₂g → ⁴T₁g(P)\n- 15 410 cm⁻¹ (weak and sharp) = ⁴A₂g → ²E_g\n\n**1. Dq**\n10Dq = 17 430 cm⁻¹, so **Dq = 1743 cm⁻¹**.\n\n**2. B**\nFor d³, ν₂ + ν₃ = 30Dq + 15B.\n- 64 000 = 52 290 + 15B\n- **B ≈ 781 cm⁻¹** (780.7)\n\nCheck using only ν₁ and ν₂: B = (2ν₁² + ν₂² − 3ν₁ν₂)/(15ν₂ − 27ν₁) = 780.7 cm⁻¹. The three spin-allowed bands agree with each other.\n\n**3. C, from the ²E band**\n- **Simple estimate:** In the strong-field limit, E(²E) − E(⁴A₂) = 9B + 3C. This gives C ≈ 2795 cm⁻¹. That value is too low because it leaves out configuration interaction.\n- **Common shortcut:** E ≈ 9B + 3C − 90B²/10Dq. This includes only the leading second-order correction and gives C ≈ 3840 cm⁻¹, which overcorrects.\n- **Full calculation:** I used the Tanabe–Sugano 4×4 ²E matrix. Its basis is t₂³, t₂²(¹E)e, t₂²(¹A₁)e and e³. I wrote this matrix from memory. As a partial check, its second-order perturbation reproduces the −90B²/10Dq correction.\n  - Diagonal elements:\n    - −12Dq − 6B + 3C\n    - −2Dq + 8B + 6C\n    - −2Dq − 2B + 6C\n    - 18Dq − 8B + 4C\n  - Off-diagonal elements: −6√2B, −3√2B, 0, 10B, √3(2B + C), 2√3B.\n  - The lowest root must sit 15 410 cm⁻¹ above ⁴A₂, which is at −12Dq − 15B.\n  - Solving for C by hand:\n    - C = 3300 gives 15 650 cm⁻¹.\n    - C = 3220 gives 15 396 cm⁻¹.\n    - Interpolating gives **C ≈ 3224 cm⁻¹**, so C/B ≈ 4.1.\n\n{\"Dq\": 1743, \"B\": 781, \"C\": 3224, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Dq from nu1, B from nu2+nu3, C by solving the full 2E matrix to the 15410 cm-1 band.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":857,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7602ff6b-00c9-43c2-a070-a7491b3b9016","uuid":"93f99cdd-7282-424e-ace3-f3c7cabc409e","timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:58:41.724Z","request_id":"req_011Cggk5QE7GeJbYVusRShqh"}
